  "description": "Two diodes back to back from the signal to ground after a series resistor: hard clipping at about ±0.6 V with silicon diodes. The ProCo Rat's clipper (R6 1k, D1 and D2 1N4148 for its 1N914; ElectroSmash's \"ProCo Rat Analysis\", electrosmash.com/proco-rat). Swap the diodes to change the clip level: LEDs higher, germanium or Schottky lower.",
